{"message":"Net change in unpaid restructuring liabilities during 2006 = ending balance 2006 minus beginning balance 2006. Beginning balance is balance at Dec 31 2005 = 116; ending balance at Dec 31 2006 = 134. Also equals activity: 155 - 141 + 4 = 18.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"134 - 116","variables":{"134":{"value":134,"source":"source:t8c1n0"},"116":{"value":116,"source":"source:t4c1n0"}},"sources":{"134":"source:t8c1n0","116":"source:t4c1n0"}}}